// CodeEditor is Tao Studio's own CodeMirror boundary: a foreign view over the active file's
// revisioned host state. The implementation stays in `packages/ides/studio`, named through the same
// product-host module the client's other views reach, so the editor and the host share one instance
// of that module's state; this app-local package is the workbench's name for it.
workspace
view CodeEditor() from ../../../packages/ides/studio/studio-src/TaoStudioProductHost.tsx
